<v Owen Blake>How was your kid's recital, Farah?</v>

22
00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:33.000
<v Farah Idris>Went great, thanks for asking. Okay, that's everything from me.</v>

23
00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:36.500
<v Maya Chen>Great session. Let's regroup next week.</v>
